I'm not sure what it's called.

00:30:29.079 --> 00:30:33.040
Oh yeah, yes, you're kind of the iridescent clouds

00:30:33.040 --> 00:30:36.359
or the, when you see those gorgeous colours in a cloud

00:30:36.920 --> 00:30:40.640
they are incredible to see because it's like a rainbow

00:30:40.640 --> 00:30:43.920
but it's more kind of localized, I suppose,

00:30:43.920 --> 00:30:46.599
in the same way as you get sun dogs,

00:30:46.599 --> 00:30:48.680
which is like a kind of a halo,

00:30:48.680 --> 00:30:52.920
which can appear on the sun or a moon or the moon rather.

