of the ice crystals or the water droplets rather,

00:30:59.239 --> 00:31:01.280
which scatters the spectrum.

00:31:01.280 --> 00:31:04.119
And then you get these amazing patches of colour in the sky.

00:31:04.520 --> 00:31:07.800
That's one thing that people love taking photos of as well

00:31:07.800 --> 00:31:10.920
because it just looks that kind of iridescence,

00:31:10.920 --> 00:31:12.319
you know, that you see.

