there weren't, just weren't so many of those.

00:33:08.959 --> 00:33:11.719
And those are human-made clouds

00:33:11.719 --> 00:33:14.599
that result from the water vapour

00:33:14.599 --> 00:33:16.719
in the exhaust of the aircraft,

00:33:16.719 --> 00:33:20.239
cooling as it rapidly expands in the high atmosphere

00:33:20.239 --> 00:33:24.199
and forming this crisp line of cloud.

00:33:24.199 --> 00:33:26.599
So long as that part of the atmosphere

00:33:26.599 --> 00:33:29.160
that the plane's flying through

00:33:29.160 --> 00:33:31.160
has enough moisture in it anyway,

00:33:31.160 --> 00:33:32.280
otherwise it doesn't form.

00:33:32.280 --> 00:33:34.839
It's a bit like when you start your car on a cold day,

